    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multimind is a relaxing game that tests the player's ability to multitask. Players need to maintain the stability of multiple game items at the same time and try to persist as long as possible as the game difficulty increases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game items on the same screen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 8 game items for players to play, supporting up to 6 game items on the same screen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Daily Challenges and Rankings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can challenge the daily challenge of the day an unlimited number of times every day. After the challenge, you can upload the results to the daily challenge rankings. You can try to get a higher score ranking by practicing.</p>",
